# The Gustaberg Tour's own Hunting_Bear onTrigger with a party (quest rework P4, beside #era): main and p2 at level 10, in
# range: every alliance member at level 15 or below and within 15 yalms, and more than one member, so 22, whose finish
# completes the quest (500 gil, Bastok fame, GUSTABERG_TOURIST). No module: the arm the era module takes away.
lists NorthGustaberg/Hunting_Bear/onTrigger NorthGustaberg/onEventFinish/22
char zone=NorthGustaberg pos=-233.9,41.465,426.5
char p2 zone=NorthGustaberg pos=-233,41.465,427
quest Bastok.TheGustabergTour accepted
login
p2: login
invite p2
p2: accept
trigger Hunting_Bear           # a party of two at level 10, in range: 22
finish                         # completed
